abstract: >
  A GeoAI toolkit turning Sentinel-1 radar and public seismic data into a
  fault deformation time series, a short-term aftershock forecast, and a
  denoised seismic signal, built against the 2023 Kahramanmaraş
  (Turkey-Syria) earthquake sequence.
